Daniel,

No apologies needed, this was a rookie mistake on my part not to play around with the values of the shape parameter that were generated by my initial values. There is indeed a small window of sig that is allowed depending on mu for the values to yield a positive shape 1 parameter, especially when mu > 0.3.

Thanks for the help, the model runs now.

F

