Subject: Re: Quick question about parameters convergence
Message-ID: <FZ_sipYbPe8.vonFv4VXCgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <FZ_sipYbPe8.ZuC--EBWCgAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
